      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Terminal 1: oc get vmi -A -w              Terminal 2: oc adm top nodes              OpenShift Console: Observe → Metrics\n   NAME          PHASE        NODE            worker-0  CPU:  4%  MEM: 38%           query: kubevirt_vmi_phase_count\n   kvpt-vmi-0    Scheduling   ...             worker-1  CPU: 12%  MEM: 42%           \n   kvpt-vmi-0    Scheduled    worker-0        worker-2  CPU: 18%  MEM: 51%           Count climbing: 0 → 75 running VMIs\n   kvpt-vmi-0    Running      worker-0   →   worker-0  CPU: 38%  MEM: 71%   ←        in 90 seconds\n   kvpt-vmi-1    Scheduling   ...             worker-1  CPU: 41%  MEM: 74%\n   kvpt-vmi-74   Running      worker-2        worker-2  CPU: 39%  MEM: 69%",
